            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I think was using the wrong terminology there, \r\nusing the config I posted in the description, workflow is like this, Open mini.files -> navigate to some directory -> open a file there -> copy a file from the selected directory -> go to  a different directory -> paste a file -> use `~` to go back to the directory of the file I opened for editing (to copy another file, etc..) mini.files asks,\r\n\r\n```\r\nThere is at least one modified buffer\r\n\r\nConfirm close without synchronization?\r\n[Y]es, (N)o:\r\n```",
